<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada to auction C$3.0 bln 7-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada to auction C$3.0 bln 7-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada plans to auction C$3.0 billion of seven-day treasury bills on Wednesday, March 26, the central bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bills will be delivered on March 27 and will mature on April 3, the Bank of Canada said.</p>
<p>The tender is subject to standard auction terms.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
